### 공통 변수
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1
@nickname = hn28


### 1. 회원가입

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "이효능",
  "birthDate": "2003-02-08",
  "phoneNumber": "01012345678",
  "nickname": "hn28",
  "pinPassword": "123456",
  "agreementIds": [1, 2, 3]
}


### 2. 회원 기본정보 조회

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json


### 3. 회원정보 수정
## UserUpdateDTO 필드에 맞춰 작성

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "수정된닉네임"
}


### 4. 닉네임 중복 확인

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/nickname/check?nickname={{nickname}}
Accept: application/json


### 5. PIN 확인

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/pin/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pinPassword": "123456"
}


### 6. PIN 변경

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/pin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPinPassword": "123456",
  "newPinPassword": "654321",
  "newPinPasswordConfirm": "654321"
}


### 7. 회원탈퇴
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "654321",
  "withdrawalReason": "서비스를 더 이상 이용하지 않음"
}